    </header>

    <div class="answer-block">
      <p>ClarifyPost was founded on a simple principle: you should get the answer to your question immediately. We provide high-quality, jargon-free "How to" guides and "What is" explanations for everyday internet users.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>The modern web is often cluttered with slow-loading pages, intrusive pop-ups, and thousands of words of "filler" content designed for search engines rather than people. ClarifyPost is different. We put the answer in the very first paragraph, then provide the context and steps you need to finish your task.</p>

    <h2>Expertise & Author</h2>
    <p>ClarifyPost is a single-author blog curated by Dippan Bhusal, a full-stack developer based in India. With a deep focus on web utility tools and SEO optimization, I build every guide to be technically accurate, fast, and easy to read.</p>
